  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The goblin makes two attacks, using Scimitar or Shortbow in any combination.\n\nScimitar. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Slashing damage, plus 2 (1d4) Slashing damage if the attack roll had Advantage.\n\nShortbow. Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 80/320 ft.\nHit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage, plus 2 (1d4) Piercing damage if the attack roll had Advantage.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.108",
        "heading": "Actions",
        "lineStart": 21375,
        "lineEnd": 21382
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Bonus Actions",
      "rulesText": "Nimble Escape. The goblin takes the Disengage or Hide action.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.108",
        "heading": "Bonus Actions",
        "lineStart": 21384,
        "lineEnd": 21386
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reactions",
      "rulesText": "Redirect Attack. Trigger: A creature the goblin can see makes an attack roll against it. Response: The goblin chooses a Small or Medium ally within 5 feet of itself. The goblin and that ally swap places, and the ally becomes the target of the attack instead.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.108",
        "heading": "Reactions",
        "lineStart": 21388,
        "lineEnd": 21390
      }
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Small Fey (Goblinoid), Chaotic Neutral\n\nAC 17\nInitiative +2 (12)\nHP 21 (6d6)\nSpeed 30 ft.\n\nSkills Stealth +6\nGear Chain Shirt, Scimitar, Shield, Shortbow\nSenses Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 9\nLanguages Common, Goblin\nCR 1 (XP 200; PB +2)\n\nActions\n\nMultiattack. The goblin makes two attacks, using Scimitar or Shortbow in any combination.\n\nScimitar. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Slashing damage, plus 2 (1d4) Slashing damage if the attack roll had Advantage.\n\nShortbow. Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 80/320 ft.\nHit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage, plus 2 (1d4) Piercing damage if the attack roll had Advantage.\n\nBonus Actions\n\nNimble Escape. The goblin takes the Disengage or Hide action.\n\nReactions\n\nRedirect Attack. Trigger: A creature the goblin can see makes an attack roll against it. Response: The goblin chooses a Small or Medium ally within 5 feet of itself. The goblin and that ally swap places, and the ally becomes the target of the attack instead.",
